# Instruction-set envelope for milestone 5.
# ceiling  : the widest registers this milestone's reference uses.
# field    : a dispatch field this milestone installs through.
# returnfile: a file whose `return X;` names an installed kernel.
# sym      : a symbol the reference's own files define.
# ownfile  : a file this milestone owns, named relative to libswscale/x86/.
#            The envelope gate is scoped to what the candidate changed: every
#            ownfile byte-identical to the base's passes it vacuously and the
#            verifier prints that it did. The Makefile is deliberately not an
#            ownfile -- it is shared bookkeeping that earlier milestones also
#            edit, so counting it would report a cumulative candidate as
#            having changed this milestone's scope when it changed nothing of
#            this milestone's.
ceiling avx2
enforce no
field yuv2plane1
field yuv2planeX
field yuv2packed1
field yuv2packed2
field yuv2packedX
field yuv2anyX
field yuv2nv12cX
ownfile output.asm
ownfile swscale.c
ownfile swscale_template.c
ownfile yuv2yuvX.asm
